  2630	## D207 · 2026-10-28 · Statements are filed by a separate placement call under the one-home rule; an unfiled statement is kept (extraction v20, `poc-v36`)
  2631	
  2632	- Alex, on the root cause ("你还是没有根因的去解决这个问题 … 要么挂不到，要么挂多"; "跑那个归档实验"; "你看着结果来做"; "一样的标准开始测"). The mechanism ([routing-analysis.md](research/2026-10-28-extraction-quality/routing-analysis.md)): the in-call link decision was a coin flip (36% right on the gold, 46–78 pieces kept from the same bytes) and the gate at once (an unlinked statement was dropped: 60% of all statements, ~15–30% of them material); the link rule routed demand news to the company-wide quantities (six root theses held 66% of all links; v2's pieces 86% double-linked, 26% cited); the thesis list had no driver layer.
  2633	- Decided, three parts measured one at a time on the frozen gold (three draws each, 8 threads, $0.04–0.05 an arm) and on the first week's 255 in-call pieces: (1) `placement.py`: one call per item with the title line, the statements and the open questions, each with a code-written 'takes' line (key, event type, research-group names; aggregates admit other populations); the sift keeps statements without a link (`keep_unlinked`); the placer's links replace the extraction's, candidate links survive; a statement filed nowhere is stored in `unplaced_statements` with the handover. (2) The rule is the placement prompt: `placement-narrow-v1` — one home, the narrowest question; company-wide figure questions take only their own figures, guidance and management statements. (3) D42's "evidence is linked at extraction" becomes: the extraction's links are its first opinion; placement decides. Gated on the prompt version (`PLACEMENT_FROM = 20`); `cfg.placement` is required from v20.
  2634	- Measured: core statements filed right 6/6/5 → 9/9/9 (with six seeded driver questions shown) and 9/10/9 under the old rule; wrong links 9 → 3; links to the two sinks 63/60/44 → 6/1/5; junk placed 53/48/32 → 39/27/35; every decisive matter statement (the Kyber/Rubin Ultra rack delay cluster, the AI Compute Partnership participants, Goldman's capex estimate) placed; one week through the whole path (`english-v36-nvda-1w-2026-10-28`, $0.22 against $0.22) kept 580 statements the old path dropped. Arms retired by measurement: the extraction's links shown as a hint (junk and sink links returned), group aliases alone (the groups lack the press names). Tests `tests/test_placement.py`, suite 222.
  2635	- Not built here: re-placement of unplaced statements when a thesis opens later (the cold-start class, 12% of gold cells); the driver layer (D208).
